'''Katsuyuki Konishi''' (Japanese: '''小西克幸''' ''Konishi Katsuyuki'') is a Japanese voice actor for {{aniseries|PTS}}.

==Pokémon roles==
Konishi had been a voice actor on {{aniseries|PTS}} since {{aniseries|OS}}. He had provide the voices of many [[Character of the day|characters of the day]] as well as Pokémon. He has not had any new roles since the end of {{aniseries|DP}}, returning only to voice [[Cynthia's Garchomp]] in {{aniseries|BW}} and [[Lauren]]'s {{p|Croagunk}} in {{aniseries|JN}}.

